MODULE: LocalDeleteLoggedAsSet
TARGET: WalComplete
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a local delete is acknowledged as a tombstone but journalled in the WAL as a Set, so re-replay would resurrect the key on the peer
PERTURBS: AWrite

--- FIND
    /\ wal' = wal \cup {[k |-> k, ts |-> clock + 1, del |-> d]}
--- REPLACE
    /\ wal' = wal \cup {[k |-> k, ts |-> clock + 1, del |-> FALSE]}
--- END
